                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4ccb076-63f0-364f-8ebf-1a8ac5ab1364",
                        "entry_id": "88c7a872-36c9-3f34-a195-27adb3b00716",
                        "glosses": [
                            "женск. к сват; мать одного из супругов по отношению к родителям другого супруга"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cb12dd4-7b61-4672-a923-86e461dc928e",
                                "sense_id": "f4ccb076-63f0-364f-8ebf-1a8ac5ab1364",
                                "text": "Там жила сватья его и крёстная мать Насти, Дарья Никитишна, знаменитая по всему краю повариха."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "33e9aa16-c270-3835-9742-c0c335dbd4f3",
                        "entry_id": "88c7a872-36c9-3f34-a195-27adb3b00716",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. то же, что сваха"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed8d692f-a45f-440a-9578-cd451d90930f",
                                "sense_id": "33e9aa16-c270-3835-9742-c0c335dbd4f3",
                                "text": "Притом холостой да мастер корабельный, дак сватьи налетают, как вороны на утёнка…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "13905bad-2b23-4678-9d3d-48c6ed1ceec1",
                        "source_entry_id": "88c7a872-36c9-3f34-a195-27adb3b00716",
                        "target_lang_word": "co-mother-in-law",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "co-mother-in-law",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16763635-195e-3b06-b083-bfb03ffcfdd0",
                                        "entry_id": "519c95c9-ad36-31c8-8e52-70c144cfe29f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The mother of one's children-in-law; that is, the mother-in-law of one's children, or, the mother of one spouse in relation to the parents of the other spouse; either of two or more women whose children marry each other, such as the mother of a bride vis-à-vis the mother of the groom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7590c68d-406e-43b0-99cb-9b503f8df66c",
                                                "sense_id": "16763635-195e-3b06-b083-bfb03ffcfdd0",
                                                "text": "After dinner, the discerning eye of the co-mother-in-law divines the work of darkness. Your wife also is an expectant mother !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec7fb092-d3a3-4de2-b055-31fe0636355c",
                                                "sense_id": "16763635-195e-3b06-b083-bfb03ffcfdd0",
                                                "text": "She had a right of entrée to the Castle now as prospective co-mother-in-law with the duchess, and made the most of it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4baa5f86-e0e0-4668-9422-1c71359e99b4",
                                                "sense_id": "16763635-195e-3b06-b083-bfb03ffcfdd0",
                                                "text": "[…] responded with temper and irritability toward her step-daughter, Anna, who was so demure and so complete a member of the new society, and toward Ngaoli, her co-mother-in-law, gaunt, old, married under the old system, a devoted church member, righteous mother of five children, who fortunately had no complications in her life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
